inhalt.text:
Parliament bans price-fixing between construction companies. {{1}}
The country gives grants to a research laboratory developing new battery technology. {{2}}
The municipality lays fibre-optic cables to every village. {{3}}
The state pays part of the training costs of companies that offer apprenticeships. {{4}}
A new law requires clear pricing in online shops. {{5}}
The country builds a new bridge across the river. {{6}}
New businesses receive start-up funding from an innovation fund in their first two years. {{7}}
The state operates and maintains the electricity grid. {{8}}
Electrical appliances may only be sold once their safety has been tested. {{9}}
